OL,3,ARiot police clash with students as
OL,4,Aeducation protests rage in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe protests began last week in the
OL,7,Fcapital Paris and have spread across
OL,8,Fthe country, with cities including
OL,9,FMontpellier, Nantes and Marseille
OL,10,Faffected.
OL,12,FFrench Justice Minister Gerald Darmanin
OL,13,Fsaid things had "gone from high-school
OL,14,Fstudent demonstrations to a public
OL,15,Forder disturbance".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
